<title>UK: Ramco appoints Rifkind non-exec director.</title>
<headline>Ramco appoints Rifkind non-exec director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ramco Energy Plc announced the appointment of former British foreign minister Malcolm Rifkind as non-executive director.</p>
<p>Rifkind will take up his position on August 1.</p>
<p>His appointment follows Ramco agreed 54 million stg bid for JKX Oil &amp; Gas Plc, which is active in Ukraine and Georgia.</p>
<p>&quot;Mr Rifkind's experience in the areas in which JKX operates, as well as in the former Soviet Union and Eastern Europe as a whole, will be invaluable towards building Ramco's business in these regions,&quot; Ramco said.</p>
<p>Ramco has activities in Azerbaijan and Georgia.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
